catalog: Panel
target: log panel
summary: The log panel type

!! Commands

* ``log:prune`` — Log: prune history before the selected label or operation
* ``log:revert`` — Log: revert what is selected, or a narrower or wider scope
* ``log:toggle`` — Log: toggle a view flag (the watcher’s work / the unchanged fields of an operation)

!! Generic commands

Provides ``parent``, ``refresh``, ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``descend``, ``entries`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
